Package: scnet-client
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: scnet-client-linux (unofficial build) <noreply@scnet-client-linux.invalid>
Depends: libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0, libnss3, libasound2t64 | libasound2, libx11-xcb1, libxss1, libxtst6, libgbm1, libdrm2, libatspi2.0-0t64 | libatspi2.0-0, libcups2t64 | libcups2, fonts-noto-cjk, xdg-utils
Recommends: libu2f-udev, libayatana-appindicator3-1 | libappindicator3-1
Description: SCNet Client (计算服务), unofficial Linux build
 Unofficial Linux build of the official SCNet desktop client, assembled from
 the upstream macOS Electron distribution @UPSTREAM_VERSION@ with Linux-native
 replacements for the platform-specific components. It provides the AI
 workspace, skills, connectors, HPC job tooling, a local terminal and file
 handling.
 .
 This package is not an official distribution and is not supported by the
 vendor. It is unsigned and intended for personal evaluation.
